# The list of modules on ritsu's site (DESIGN 17.17): build.sh writes it with `ritsu mod site`, in
# English under build/modules/list and in Japanese under build/ja/modules/list. It shows the seed
# module as it is on ghcr.io, every version modules.yml has pushed, and checks each against the
# signature modules.yml made, as this repository's workflow (cosign, which docs.yml installs).
# crates/ritsu/tests/website.rs builds the site with no network, from the module's working tree.
title "ritsu modules"
description "Modules published from the ritsu repository"
module "ghcr.io/i2y/ritsu-holidays"
signature "ghcr.io/i2y/ritsu-holidays" by matching "^https://github[.]com/i2y/ritsu/" issuer "https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com"
